# Export script (an extension): File > Export > Script... writes the
# model as a Go program that builds it again (File.ExportScript), here a
# rectangle drawn and extruded. The file dialog takes the path; a
# second export leaves it unanswered and writes nothing.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
file $tmp/model.go
menu File|Export|Script (.go)...
dump
menu File|Export|Script (.go)...
dump
